"Say “remember that …” to keep a fact (never passwords or keys), “forget everything” to clear. After something works, say “save that as a skill called morning setup”; saying “morning setup” replays its steps, each through the safety gate. Plain files in ~/.s1 — edit them freely. The current session's history is always shared with S1 and S2." = "Bilang “ingat bahwa …” untuk menyimpan fakta (jangan pernah kata sandi atau kunci), “lupakan semuanya” untuk menghapus. Setelah sesuatu berhasil, bilang “simpan itu sebagai skill bernama morning setup”; menyebut “morning setup” memutar ulang langkahnya, masing-masing lewat gerbang keamanan. File biasa di ~/.s1 — edit bebas. Riwayat sesi saat ini selalu dibagikan ke S1 dan S2.";
